# NUAR CRM Architectural & Design Standards

Single source of truth: **`AGENTS.md`** (located at repository root).

Refer to `AGENTS.md` for:
- 4-tier style hierarchy and `/today` as the official design benchmark.
- Canonical design tokens in `src/styles/tokens.css`.
- UI primitives in `src/components/ui/` (`Button`, `Input`, `Badge`, `Dialog`, `AppIcon`, etc.).
- Mobile responsiveness guidelines (touch target >= 44-48px, 393x852 iPhone reference, no page-level horizontal scroll).
- Strict prohibitions (no raw hex colors, no direct `lucide-react` imports, no local CSS variables).
- 9-point verification checklist before completing tasks.
- Operational context for Hetzner VPS and Lavandi CMS integration.
